#
# Expected Criterion benchmark groups of benches/clap_bench.rs.
# Consumed by `nam_perf_gate coverage|verdict --suite clap_bench --manifest`.
# A trailing '*' matches any executed id with that prefix; a group that did not
# run makes the coverage cross-check fail closed (partial/filtered runs cannot
# certify). `CLAP_Evidence` is the end-to-end inference anchor matrix.
CLAP_Infrastructure_*
CLAP_Inference_*
CLAP_WorstCase_*
CLAP_Evidence_*
